      <rulesStrings>
        <li>questDescription-&gt;Qinxintang: The resettlement will need some supplies. Not a campaign this time - could you gather a batch of chocolate bars for us? We will set aside another batch of goods in exchange.
Deliver within 5 days of accepting. Complete it through the Alliance contact delivery entry; items are not deducted if you fall short. Success raises Alliance goodwill by 5 and does not advance the endgame progress.</li>
      </rulesStrings>
    </questDescriptionRules>
    <root Class="MinchoCandyWars.QuestStory.DeliveryRoot">
      <kind>7</kind>
    </root>
  </QuestScriptDef>
